Bedrock does support per-entity inputAction/outputAction and enabled flags, so that's a viable lever too. Likely culprits for the false positive could be USERNAME, DRIVER_ID, PASSWORD, LICENSE_PLATE, or NAME, but I shouldn't assume which one without more info.

